DESCRIPTION:Join us for this info-session if you are thinking about applyi
 ng to Akin Career Launcher!\n\nAkin Career Launcher: Info Session & Tour D
 ate/Time: Monday\, December 7\, 2026\, 5:00 - 7:00 p.m. Location: Akin Rem
 ote Gallery\, 568a Richmond St. West\, Toronto Register to attend Join us 
 for this info-session if you are thinking about applying to Akin Career La
 uncher. You will hear from Farah Yusuf\, OCAD U CEAD Special Projects Coor
 dinator\, about the Akin Career Launcher and how to put together a strong 
 application. Renato Baldin\, Gallery Manager at Remote Gallery\, will spea
 k to the many ways Remote Gallery can be utilized and show some examples f
 rom previous Akin Career Launcher recipients’ exhibitions and events. Ch
 arlotte Van Ryn\, Studio Manager at Akin Richmond-Bathurst\, will give an 
 overview of Akin’s studio locations and memberships\, and lead a studio 
 tour of Akin’s Richmond-Bathurst location after the info session. Learn 
 more about the 2027 Akin Career Launcher Call For Artists
LOCATION:Off Campus Akin Remote Gallery\, 568a Richmond St. West\, Toronto
