UID:ocad-university-senate-meeting-21@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:OCAD University Senate Meeting\n\nThe next regular meeting of 
 the OCAD University Senate is scheduled to take place on Monday\, November
  30\, 2026 from 3:15 pm – 5:30 pm EDT. The Senate is responsible for the
  establishment and regulation of academic policy\, standards and procedure
 s at OCAD University. The Senate and its many committees are in charge of 
 all matters pertaining to OCAD U academic resources\, academic programming
 \, academic strategic planning\, student affairs and any other such matter
 s relating to academic issues. More information can be found on the OCAD U
  Senate webpage . If you would like to attend as a guest\, or if you have 
 any questions\, please contact David Wagschal\, Quality Assurance Officer 
 & Associate Senate Secretary at dwagschal@ocadu.ca . Please note: Requests
  to attend public meetings must be made at least one business day in advan
 ce of the meeting .
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/ocad-university-senate-mee
 ting-21
