UID:poetry-art-writing-workshop@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Poetry as Art: A Writing Workshop\n\nLearn something new about
  the art of writing poetry. Are you interested in how poetry can be both l
 iteral and visual in nature? Bella Melardi is an OCAD U Creative Writing s
 tudent who has studied poetry for many years and wants to share her passio
 n with the world. Learn about different forms of poetry and how to create 
 sentences that sound like artwork. You will also learn about the history o
 f poetry and have a chance to write your own poems! Come join Bella's Poet
 ry Workshop on November 14th\, 2026\, at Say Hey House! Purchase tickets h
 ere
